<title>SWEDEN: Volvo truck orders rise 32 pct to April.</title>
<headline>Volvo truck orders rise 32 pct to April.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish vehicle maker AB Volvo's truck unit said on Wednesday its order intake rose 32 percent worldwide in the first four months of the year.</p>
</text>
